                "message": "Add sp-treemacs: a file tree for the emacs-modular folder on <f9>\n\nNew UI module that installs treemacs and toggles a side window rooted at\nuser-emacs-directory, with its literate doc in docs/tangles. Loaded from\nthe window management group in init.el.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C3wkyoUfEEQ3ZAcMMvct4L",
